r10868"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfash37187/"></a>Зачисление в состав основных средств финансового арендуемых объектов после окончания договора финансовой аренды</td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align:top; width:12.03%; text-align:center; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10869/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10869" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10869"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfassoy4os/"></a>0110-0190</td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align:top; width:13.9%; text-align:center; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10870/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10870" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10870"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfasxrsuub/"></a>0310</td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="text-align:center; overflow-wrap:break-word; width:5.04%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10871/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10871" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10871"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfasolhhrn/"></a>4.</p></td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align:top; text-align:left; width:68.88%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10872/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10872" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10872"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfascgfdhh/"></a>Оприходование основных средств, внесенных учредителями в качестве вкладов (паев) в уставный капитал или поступивших в счет оплаты за акции</td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align:top; width:12.03%; text-align:center; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10873/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10873" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr1