rd"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10879/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10879" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10879"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfas8y72fq/"></a>6.</p></td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align:top; text-align:left; width:68.88%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10880/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10880" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10880"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfasnie97i/"></a>Поступили основные средства от обособленных подразделений, дочерних и зависимых хозяйственных обществ</td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align:top; width:12.03%; text-align:center; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10881/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10881" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10881"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfas3y2bne/"></a>0110-0190</td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align:top; width:13.9%; text-align:center; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10882/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10882" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10882"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfasmog13z/"></a>6110,6120</td></tr><tr><td class="bdAll" style="text-align:center; vertical-align:top; overflow-wrap:break-word; width:5.04%; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10883/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="10883" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr10883"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfasxl00dl/"></a>7.</p></td><td class="bdAll" style="vertical-align:top; text-align:left; width:68.88%; word-wrap: break-word"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr10884/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id