-id="2555" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2555"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfas3pfhsy/"></a>22.</p></td><td style="text-align:left; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr2556/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2556" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2556"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfasg8ik8o/"></a>Списаны затраты и услуги вспомогательных цехов, произведенные ими при капитальных вложениях</p></td><td style="text-align:center; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr2557/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2557" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2557"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfasdo3m9r/"></a>0810-0890</p></td><td style="text-align:center; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr2558/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2558" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2558"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfasizaeh9/"></a>2310</p></td></tr><tr><td style="text-align:center; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr2559/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2559" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2559"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfaszngf30/"></a>23.</p></td><td style="text-align:left; word-wrap: break-word"><p><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/bssPhr2560/" data-role="phrase-anchor" data-phrase-id="2560" data-dwh-source-type-favorites="button_anchor" data-phrase-anchor="bssPhr2560"></a><a data-anchor="/document/90/4023/dfasgg92kf/"></a>Возврат материалов, ранее списанных на нужды вспомогательных производств</p></td><td style="text-align:center; word-wrap: break-word"><p style="text-align:center"><a data-anchor="/document/90/